WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.411
- [Narrator] In the center
of Seoul, South Korea,

00:00:03.411 --> 00:00:06.090
there's a neighborhood known as Yongsan.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:08.329
Most people had no reason to come here.

00:00:08.329 --> 00:00:10.529
It was a little rough around the edges.

00:00:10.529 --> 00:00:14.196
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:24.298 --> 00:00:26.881
(upbeat music)

00:00:37.649 --> 00:00:40.206
- [Narrator] This is Kim Yun-kyu,

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.289
he's the main guy leading

00:00:41.289 --> 00:00:43.429
the charge to convince young people

00:00:43.429 --> 00:00:46.048
and small businesses to open shop.

00:00:46.048 --> 00:00:47.760
(all laughing)

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:50.439
To be part of Passion Island,
you have to live locally

00:00:50.439 --> 00:00:54.439
and stay true to the
spirit of the neighborhood.

00:01:12.593 --> 00:01:14.410
- [Narrator] This
ongoing change has turned

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:16.782
the neighborhood from one of the scariest,

00:01:16.782 --> 00:01:19.633
to one of the coolest places in town.

00:01:19.633 --> 00:01:23.300
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:32.454 --> 00:01:33.970
- [Narrator] This is a
pretty radical business plan

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:38.000
in South Korea, but
these ideas are working.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.500
Passion Island is now the hip place to be.

00:02:11.251 --> 00:02:15.168
(shouting in foreign language)

